answers.approach:
Gate the egress, not
the record — expire copies;
audit by replay.

Trace one real opt-out through every copy’s flow,
Then plant synthetic people and watch where signals go.

A token is no talisman, though standards may shine bright;
Each hop must send a signed receipt and block forbidden flight.

For audiences, partners, features, set contracts to one tune;
Quarantine, delete, or retrain beneath the watching moon.

Prove only what is provable; mark what vendors keep;
Models won’t forget on command—the gap stays awake while we sleep.
